ull,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_6","text":"Again, we're not familiar with this \"Angel\" you speak of.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_7","text":"I suspect that Massive Object might be something Gatekeeper created after seeing those \"Angels\" from your world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce004_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_8","text":"You keep mentioning the word \"Gatekeeper\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce004_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_9","text":"What is that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_10","text":"It's a special entity which can manifest living and nonliving organisms from other dimensions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_11","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_11","text":"Rapi begins to tell our interdimensional visitors about Gatekeeper's powers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_12","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_12","text":"My memory is a bit foggy. I'll listen to her explanation.","jump":"event_ce004_1_01_e_14","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_13","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_13","text":"I already know all about Gatekeeper. I'll let my mind wander for a few moments.","jump":"event_ce004_1_01_e_32","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_14","text":"In our world, a previously unseen entity with the code name \"Gatekeeper\" was discovered.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_15","text":"This entity emits energy waves which resemble those seen during sleep. We refer to these as D-Waves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_16","text":"At the same time, individuals like yourself, seemingly from different worlds, began materializing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce004_1_01_e_17","text":"Further investigations uncovered that these people also emitted D-Wave energy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce004_1_01_e_18"